778
00:31:54.860 --> 00:31:59.340
Well, this whole storyline was based on a very real-life thing that was happening on the side of The Office,
嗯，整个剧情线是基于《办公室》拍摄期间现实生活中发生的一件事，

779
00:31:59.560 --> 00:32:02.560
which was that we were obsessed with Words with Friends.
那就是我们当时都沉迷于《Words with Friends》这款游戏。

780
00:32:02.880 --> 00:32:03.260
Yes.
没错。

781
00:32:03.480 --> 00:32:05.200
It was the cast and the crew.
演员和剧组人员都在玩。

782
00:32:05.200 --> 00:32:08.860
We would sit in hair and makeup in the morning, and we would do Words with Friends.
我们早上会坐在化妆间里，玩《Words with Friends》。

783
00:32:09.200 --> 00:32:10.460
