00:32:20.460 --> 00:32:25.400
Well, you know, a few years ago, Rain and I played each other in Scrabble Go, and I beat him.
嗯，你知道，几年前，雷恩和我在《Scrabble Go》里对战，我赢了他。

791
00:32:26.000 --> 00:32:26.800
I remember.
我记得。

792
00:32:26.900 --> 00:32:28.580
I was so proud of you.
我当时为你感到骄傲。

793
00:32:28.680 --> 00:32:29.980
He was so stunned.
他当时惊呆了。

794
00:32:30.160 --> 00:32:31.620
I was like, take that, Rain.
我当时心想，尝尝这个吧，雷恩。

795
00:32:32.160 --> 00:32:34.620
Well, I noticed we're not playing Words with Friends on the show.
嗯，我注意到我们在剧里玩的不是《Words with Friends》。

796
00:32:34.700 --> 00:32:38.460
We're playing Scrabble, and I became curious, what is the difference between these two games?
我们在玩拼字游戏，我很好奇，这两个游戏有什么区别？

797
00:32:38.620 --> 00:32:39.400
Is there a difference?
有区别吗？

798
00:32:40.320 --> 00:32:47.920
Well, Words with Friends was an online app that then became a board game version that you can buy.
嗯，《Words with Friends》是一款在线应用，后来出了可以购买的实体桌游版本。

799
00:32:48.180 --> 00:32:52.720
It came out in 2009, and there's only a few differences.
它在2009年推出，两者只有几处细微差别。

800
00:32:52.980 --> 00:32:55.660
It's basically the layout of the bonus squares.
基本上就是奖励格子的布局不同。

801
00:32:55.920 --> 00:33:01.820
In Scrabble, they go in an X, and then in Words with Friends, they're sort of scattered around.
在《拼字游戏》里，它们呈X形排列，而在《Words with Friends》里，它们则是散乱分布的。

802
00:33:01.820 --> 00:33:10.500
